Raiq
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
COLUMN 0 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 9 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 1 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 10 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 6 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    DEST Empty
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DESTSRC Rank equal
MOVE_STACK COLUMN COLUMN
SRCSTACK Suit match_color
$win
PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
